    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Personalization"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "个性化标签": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Personal tags"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "添加个性化标签": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Add personal tags"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "编辑个性化标签": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Edit personal tags"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "例如：爱拍照，慢热，喜欢猫": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "For example: Photography, Quiet, Cat lover"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "标签过多或过长，请修改后保存。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Too many tags or a tag is too long. Edit before saving."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "最多 3 个标签，每个不超过 12 个字，用逗号分隔。标签会显示在你的朋友圈封面上。": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Add up to 3 tags, with up to 12 characters each, separated by commas. Tags appear on your Moments cover."
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "清空标签": {
    "localizations": {
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Clear tags"
        }
      }
    }
  },
    "保存并继续": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save and continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先认识一下你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Let’s get to know you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填一个喜欢的名称。头像、生日和星座可以留空，以后随时在“我的”里修改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a name you like. Your photo, birthday, and zodiac sign are optional. You can edit them anytime in Me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "聊天时，好友会参考你填写的名称、生日和星座来了解你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "During chats, friends can refer to the name, birthday, and zodiac sign you enter."
