    },
    "iOS 需要完整日历访问权限才能读取。Lumi 仅读取今明两天事件的标题和时间，并发给你配置的模型；不会新增或修改事件。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS requires full calendar access for reading. Lumi only reads event titles and times for today and tomorrow and sends them to your model provider. It never creates or edits events."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSON" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JSON"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumi" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumi"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumi 不收集 Apple 账号，也不会自动替你续签。到期后请在原侧载工具中刷新，避免删除 App 导致本机数据丢失。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumi does not collect your Apple Account or renew signing for you. Refresh through the original sideloading tool. Deleting the app can erase local data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumi 即将到期，请打开 AltStore 或 SideStore 刷新签名。续签前建议保存一份备份。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
