    "仅在前台连续使用时计时。提醒你休息、喝水，给现实中的亲友留些时间。进入后台后重新计时，不发送额外通知。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tracks continuous foreground use. Take breaks, drink water, and make time for people around you. The timer resets in the background; no extra notifications are sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅累计此版本起服务商实际返回的输入与输出 Token，包含工具续轮、记忆整理、日记和主动问候。缓存命中属于输入的一部分，不重复相加。旧聊天不补算；停止或网络中断可能无法获取用量。此数据不是账单。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Counts provider-reported input and output tokens from this version onward, including tool rounds, memory, diaries and greetings. Cached tokens are part of input and are not added twice. Past chats are not estimated. Interrupted requests may have no usage report. This is not a billing statement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
