        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts after eight idle seconds following your message. Stops at the round or usage limit, when you leave, when the app enters the background, or when you tap Stop. Another message starts a new session. Usage is conservatively estimated from text bytes, not the provider’s bill."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你发送消息后，空闲 8 秒开始。达到轮数或用量上限会停止并提示；离开聊天页面后仍会继续，点击停止可结束。切到系统后台后能否完成取决于系统允许运行的时间。再次发消息会重新开始。用量按文字字节保守预估，并非服务商账单。" : {

