    "另外两个动作：“对角色说一句话”发送消息并通知回复；“给角色发送一条消息并获取回复”将文字结果交给后续动作，也可选择通知。你可在快捷指令中将结果朗读或显示。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘Say something to a character’ sends a message and notifies you of the reply. ‘Send a message and get a reply’ returns text for the next action, with optional notification. You can then speak or display the result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只发送上方预览图，不包含聊天记录。识别结果可在保存前修改。原图仍留在本机。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the preview above is sent, without chat history. You can edit the description before saving. The original image stays on this device."
          }
