    },
    "只在新聊天中显示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shown only in a new chat"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只在新聊天中显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只导出选中的对话。内容可能包含隐私，分享前请检查。卡片最多 8 条，每条展示前 500 字；JSON 包含原始附件，HTML 展示图片与文字。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only selected messages are exported. Review private content before sharing. Cards show up to 8 messages and 500 characters per message. JSON includes original attachments; HTML includes images and text."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有启用的图库可供选择。AI 每轮最多两张，同一好友至少间隔一分钟；找不到合适图片时保留文字。关闭后不再向模型提供表情说明或工具。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only enabled libraries are available. AI may send up to two stickers per reply, at least one minute apart for each friend. If no image matches, text remains. Turning this off removes sticker instructions and tools from new requests."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以继续说，消息会排队发送" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
