    "已将固定人设与规则前置、动态资料后置，并固定请求数据顺序以提高缓存复用机会。命中率只统计服务商返回缓存数据的输入，实际命中由服务商决定。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stable personas and rules come first, changing context comes later, and request data uses a consistent order to improve cache reuse. The hit rate covers only input with cache reports. Actual hits are determined by the provider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已有同名内容，或此内容正在由另一个来源管理。" : {
