    },
    "平时仅注入一行简介；挂载或模型调用时才加载正文。token 为本地估算。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only a one-line summary is normally included. Instructions load when attached or requested by the model. Tokens are estimated locally."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，Lumi 会将好友设定、关系、档案及近期记忆发给你配置的模型，预先准备约一周问候。到点通知由本机发送；问候用尽前会留下一句温和收尾。统计按通知到点计算，系统专注模式可能延迟显示。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, Lumi sends the friend persona, relationship, profile and recent memories to your configured model to prepare about a week of greetings. This device delivers notifications, with a gentle closing before greetings run out. Counts use scheduled delivery times; Focus may delay presentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，Lumi 会将角色、关系、档案及近期记忆发给你配置的模型，预先准备约一周问候。到点通知由本机发送；问候用尽前会留下一句温和收尾。统计按通知到点计算，系统专注模式可能延迟显示。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, Lumi sends the character, relationship, profile and recent memories to your model to prepare about a week of greetings. Notifications are sent locally, ending with a gentle closing message. Counts reflect scheduled times; Focus may delay presentation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，电量百分比和充电状态会随请求发给模型。关闭任意情境后，将取消含该情境的未来问候，并重新准备。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, battery level and charging state are sent to your model. Turning off any context cancels upcoming greetings containing it and prepares replacements."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启并授权定位后，将约一公里精度的位置发给 Open-Meteo 获取当前天气；只有天气摘要会发给模型，位置不会写入聊天或数据库。后台不主动获取新位置。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled with location permission, approximate coordinates at roughly one-kilometre precision are sent to Open-Meteo for current weather. Only a weather summary goes to your model; coordinates are never saved in chat or the database. No new location is requested in the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启续签提醒" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enable renewal reminder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启自动记忆后，每 8 轮对话或离开聊天时，会将近期对话发送给你配置的服务商整理记忆；每日小结也由该模型生成。你可以关闭自动整理，并随时编辑或删除本地记忆。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With automatic memory enabled, recent chats are sent to your provider every 8 exchanges or when leaving a chat. The same model generates daily summaries. You can disable automation and edit or delete local memories anytime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启自动记忆后，每 8 轮对话或离开聊天时，会将近期对话发送给你配置的服务商整理记忆；每日小结也由该模型生成。你可以关闭自动整理，并随时编辑或删除本地记忆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开始与结束相同时表示全天均可通知。时间会自然浮动约 15 分钟，多日未回应会自动减少问候。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Matching start and end times allow notifications all day. Timing varies by up to 15 minutes. Greetings become less frequent after several days without a reply."
          }
        }
      }
    },
