    "技能包" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skill Packs"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "技能只包含参考文字，不运行代码。读取日历、获取附近天气、保存记忆、设置提醒或播放声音等工具操作会先在聊天里请求授权；结果会提供给当前模型。始终允许可在工具授权中撤销。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Skills are reference text and cannot run code. Tools ask for approval before reading calendar events, getting nearby weather, saving memories, setting reminders, or playing sounds. Results are shared with the current model. Revoke ongoing permission in Tool permissions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
