      }
    },
    "阈值须按熟悉、暧昧、恋人递增。关系初始为陌生。模型每轮最多改变 3 点，每天最多增加或减少 6 点；重复发送和重新生成不会重复加分。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thresholds must increase from Familiar to Growing closer to Partners. Relationships start as New. Each exchange changes up to 3 points, with at most 6 points gained or lost per day. Repeated messages and regeneration earn no extra points."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "阈值须按熟悉、暧昧、恋人递增。关系初始为陌生。模型每轮最多改变 3 点，每天最多增加或减少 6 点；重复发送和重新生成不会重复加分。"
          }
        }
      }
