    "模板默认开启工具调用和视觉。更换模型时，请按模型实际支持的能力调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Templates enable tools and vision by default. When changing models, adjust these switches to match the model’s capabilities."
          }
        }
      }
    },

    "默认关闭。开启后，此群可读取成员的私聊事实，成员私聊可读取自己在此群的回忆摘录。关闭后不再传入；已经发送给模型的内容无法收回。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. When enabled, the group can use members’ private memory facts, and private chats can use their own group excerpts. Turning it off stops future sharing; content already sent to the model cannot be recalled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认模型为 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash。Lumi 不代购或收取模型费用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The default model is DeepSeek V4.1 Flash. Lumi does not sell API credits or charge model fees."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认每轮合并为 1 次请求，成员按话题选择接话，可连续补充；@ 多位时会全部回应。格式异常会额外重试，最多再逐人请求。" : {

    },
    "默认每轮合并为 1 次请求，约 1–3 位好友参与；@ 多位时会全部回应。格式异常会额外重试，最多再逐人请求。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "By default, one combined request per round includes 1–3 friends. Everyone mentioned must reply. An invalid format triggers one retry, then individual requests if needed."
          }
        }
      }
    }
